+ * The panel's blanking is short (66 of 2466 lines, 0.22 ms at 119 Hz) and the timer often woke
+ * after it: copies that waited for the next one left most frames unshown (iOS/runs/ios-smooth2,
+ * "terrible lag"). A late tick now copies anyway - a possible tear instead of a lost frame - and
+ * the real fix is a page flip in the pipe (SDE latches a new SRC0_ADDR at vsync by itself). The
+ * pipes and CTLs the ABL left are logged for it, read only: SSPP at mdp + qcom,sde-sspp-off
+ * (VIG 0x5000-0xb000, DMA 0x25000-0x2b000; SRC0_ADDR +0x14), CTL at mdp + 0x2000 + 0x200 n
+ * (LAYER 0x00-0x10/0x24, TOP 0x14, FLUSH 0x18; sde_hw_ctl.c).
+ */
+#define SWEET_MDP_PA            0x0ae00000u
+#define SWEET_MDP_SIZE          0x0002c000u
